
// The oneof's LAST branch (@b) only partially covers the amount (30 of 100).
// A last branch's result must STAND (never be rolled back), and here it is then
// consumed by the enclosing inorder source: @b contributes 30, @c the rest (70).
// If the last branch were wrongly restored, @b's 30 would be undone and only @c
// would post.
send [GEM 100] (
  source = {
    oneof {
      @a
      @b
    }
    @c
  }
  destination = @dest
)
